nks by email, and enforce configured verification and resend attempt limits.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-4\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-2\",\n    \"I-3\",\n    \"ASM-1\",\n    \"ASM-9\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 1\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"Customer organisations have separate orders, deliveries, certificates, or recall records.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-5.1\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 403 or the contract-defined not-found status and contains no other-organisation record.\",\n     \"when\": \"An authenticated user from one organisation lists or requests another organisation's records.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A staff member is assigned to one warehouse and another warehouse has records.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-5.2\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response list contains only assigned-warehouse records and an inaccessible-record response contains no record value.\",\n     \"when\": \"The staff member lists or requests warehouse-scoped stock, receipts, orders, routes, or quality records outside the assignment.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"An Auditor is authenticated and a record is available.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-5.3\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The read response contains the record and each prohibited write response status is 403.\",\n     \"when\": \"The Auditor reads the record and attempts a contracted create, update, or delete operation.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"An account has been deactivated or removed.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-5.4\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 401 or 403 and contains no protected record.\",\n     \"when\": \"That account makes a subsequent authenticated request to a protected contracted operation.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A Quality Manager or Auditor is authenticated and requests a record in a warehouse outside an ordinary staff member's assignment